### Geospatial & Third-Party Licensing Attributions:
- **OpenStreetMap**: Base geospatial layers, arterial road centerlines, bridges, and settlement centroids utilize data from OpenStreetMap under the **Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0** (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/). Base data © OpenStreetMap contributors.
- **Geological Survey of India (GSI)**: Susceptibility zonation factors adhere to National Landslide Susceptibility Mapping (NLSM) scientific standards.
- **ISRO / NRSC**: Historical event catalog structures adhere to the Landslide Atlas of India (1998-2022).
- **Copernicus Data Space**: European Space Agency (ESA) Sentinel-1 SAR & Sentinel-2 MSI data accessed under Copernicus Open Access Policy (CC BY-SA 4.0).\n